; Amiga 500 (OCS, PAL) custom chips: the shared state. Agnus (beam, DMA,
; copper, blitter), Denise (display), Paula (interrupts, audio, disk). Every
; module includes this first. Written in the subset PureMetal and PureBasic
; both compile, for the desktop program and the Pico build alike.

